 ATTRIBUTION

 This project was inspired by and derived from:
   KeepThisTicket/weatherClock
   https://github.com/KeepThisTicket/weatherClock

 The original concept, dial layout, and 3D-printable enclosure design
 are the work of K3vinWu (KeepThisTicket on GitHub). This project is a
 substantial rewrite focused on Pi Zero W stability and SDL2 KMSDRM
 rendering, but the visual concept and enclosure design are theirs.

 The 3D enclosure STL files are NOT redistributed in this repository.
 To print the case, please download them from the original project linked
 above.

 Other third-party components used (with their own licenses):
   - pygame                  (LGPL)
   - SDL2                    (zlib)
   - Pillow (PIL)            (MIT-CMU)
   - requests                (Apache 2.0)
   - Meteocons (optional)    (https://github.com/basmilius/meteocons)
   - Inter font (optional)   (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
